message: "If you use this dataset, code, or figures, please cite it as below."
title: "Settlements: Quantitative Panel and Interactive Map"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Pedahzur
    given-names: Ami
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0925-4993"
    affiliation: "University of Haifa"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pedahzur/settlements"
url: "https://pedahzur.github.io/settlements/"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible settlement-level panel combining population, electoral,
  socio-economic, built-up-area, and geographic measures for Israeli
  settlements and related localities in the West Bank, East Jerusalem, and
  the Golan Heights. The release includes a canonical entity registry,
  analysis-ready CSV and SQLite outputs, a curated research workbook, figures,
  source provenance, and a public interactive map.
keywords:
  - Israeli settlements
  - West Bank
  - East Jerusalem
  - Golan Heights
  - political geography
  - population
  - elections
  - geospatial data
  - reproducible research
